#: rc.cpp:17
msgid ""
"The program executes 100 jobs in 4 threads. Each job waits for a random "
"number of milliseconds between 1 and 1000."
msgstr ""
"Dat Programm föhrt 100 Opgaven in 4 Sträng ut. Elk Opgaav töövt en tofällig "
"Tiet twischen 0 un 1000 Millisekunnen."

